#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:1
#: 21809dfc2eee48ae8f661470c64eb88a
msgid "从训练误差定位下一轮数据缺口"
msgstr "Find the next data gap from training errors"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:3
#: 57079dae876549ba90e449ef5204dec7
msgid ""
"这条流程适合已经完成一次 NEP 训练、准备决定下一轮补什么数据的人。它不以“删掉所有大误差点” "
"为目标，而是把误差点还原到真实结构和来源，区分标签问题、坏构型和训练集缺口。"
msgstr ""
"This workflow is for users who have completed an NEP training run and "
"need to decide what data to add next. Its goal is not to delete every "
"large-error point, but to trace each error back to the real structure and"
" its source, distinguishing label problems, bad configurations, and gaps "
"in the training set."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:6
#: cfc8f93641704ea0ba80e88123b245d6
msgid "1. 打开训练结果"
msgstr "1. Open the training results"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:8
#: 338004eb8a664747bef925c5343f9b09
#
msgid ""
"在 `NEP 数据集查看` 中打开训练输出目录，确认能量、力和 virial 的参考值与预测值已经载入。 "
"如果某类输出文件缺失，只分析当前真实可用的数据，不把缺失量当成零误差。"
msgstr ""
"Open the training-output directory in `NEP Dataset Display` and confirm "
"that reference and predicted values for energy, force, and virial have "
"loaded. If a class of output file is missing, analyze only the data that "
"are actually available; do not treat missing values as zero error."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:11
#: b2f12961ab3043738c84730c3baac2d2
msgid "先确认两件事："
msgstr "Confirm two things first:"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:13
#: dbb495e51111426fb0fa335b1a676d6c
msgid "图中的参考值和预测值分别来自哪里；"
msgstr "where the reference and predicted values in the plot come from;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:14
#: 89cb53cd640c40489db6c7ce5cc939f3
msgid "当前显示的是训练集、测试集，还是另一个独立结构集合。"
msgstr ""
"whether the current view is the training set, test set, or another "
"independent structure collection."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:16
#: 788512be262e4602ad2d43023880ad53
msgid "2. 先看误差集中在哪里"
msgstr "2. First locate where the errors concentrate"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:18
#: e26870adf91346399eb3698acf2c6825
msgid "不要只记录一个总 RMSE。依次检查："
msgstr "Do not record only one overall RMSE. Check the following in order:"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:20
#: 723d9043d85249cd93910398416fe9b1
msgid "energy、force 和 virial 是否只有一种量明显偏差；"
msgstr "whether only one of energy, force, or virial is clearly biased;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:21
#: bc35435503d04e4d9204f5a31aa0c975
msgid "大误差是否集中在少数 `Config_type`；"
msgstr "whether large errors concentrate in a few `Config_type` values;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:22
#: 5f8bb39611694740b2cdc0d6ac1f0d3a
msgid "是否集中在某种组分、表面、缺陷、应变或磁构型；"
msgstr ""
"whether they concentrate in a composition, surface, defect, strain, or "
"magnetic configuration;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:23
#: 73ec8b47f5b448b298f9fb3f4b8183ed
msgid "同一结构附近是否已经有足够相似的训练样本。"
msgstr ""
"Whether enough similar training samples already exist near the same "
"structure."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:25
#: a590703d6f65401b9fb5023d15fb0472
#
msgid "使用 `查找最大误差点` 选择最大误差结构，再查看右侧结构、元素组成和来源标签。 需要批量查看某个误差范围时，使用 `按范围选择`。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Find Max Error Point` to select the largest-error structure, then "
"inspect its structure, composition, and source labels on the right. Use "
"`Select by Range` to review an error interval in batches."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:28
#: b8a6e91b942f4e9b9469a89b61b934a8
msgid "3. 进入训练集评估"
msgstr "3. Open Training Set Audit"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:30
#: 7f053a4e153245ac99471850491489c1
msgid "点击左侧图表工具栏中的 `训练集评估`。先看概览中的训练阻塞项，再查看："
msgstr "Click `Training Set Audit` in the plot toolbar on the left. Review training blockers on the Overview first, then inspect:"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:32
#: 59ab74163e474a449082bde2aac05fff
msgid "精确组分与低频集合；"
msgstr "exact compositions and low-frequency subsets;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:33
#: 4d94d277531a4fedb87c8452c1d91181
msgid "高力和高能量尾部；"
msgstr "high-force and high-energy tails;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:34
#: efa0ef5261364913ba4d3b0eeb9412e4
msgid "局域环境与元素对接触；"
msgstr "local environments and element-pair contacts;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:35
#: 20e8486eafb04bb79ecbcf9dd31d4bca
msgid "结构相和磁类型；"
msgstr "structural phases and magnetic types;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:36
#: 77357ce77d854a3f99d9580bc7ae0b1c
msgid "重复几何或标签冲突。"
msgstr "duplicate geometries or label conflicts."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:38
#: f0d37f0efde24a9c99dd752ab9c7d23c
msgid ""
"训练集评估给出的是当前数据内部证据。某个组分数量较多，不代表该组分的温压、缺陷或局域环境 "
"已经覆盖；没有独立测试集时，也不能仅凭训练集预测判断模型已经泛化。"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit reports evidence within the current data. A large "
"count for one composition does not prove that its pressure, temperature, "
"defects, or local environments are covered; without an independent test "
"set, training-set predictions alone cannot establish generalization."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:41
#: e3181a84bc6d4dbfacbdd2e1fe3f3880
msgid "4. 给每类问题选择处理方向"
msgstr "4. Choose a response for each problem type"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 56024be78e3b4050858cdbe1bb81c074
msgid "看到的现象"
msgstr "Observed symptom"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: c190822382464e3ead37f49390ecf439
msgid "先做什么"
msgstr "First action"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 1f0152f1b7bc4222b694ecd7fa2416f3
msgid "不要直接做什么"
msgstr "Do not do this directly"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 65fa9b99d1404dc591bb9d050daf2f67
msgid "同一几何对应冲突标签"
msgstr "Conflicting labels for the same geometry"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 3046dee208f84241bda8af2583815e0c
msgid "回查 DFT 输出、单位和结构映射"
msgstr "Recheck the DFT output, units, and structure mapping"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: c9e3bdcd03004fc692c3d16aba2ee02b
msgid "把其中一条随机删掉"
msgstr "Randomly delete one label"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: c8b0ad7d562c486baff2c2035a8c8e80
msgid "明显原子重叠或异常表面"
msgstr "Obvious atomic overlap or an abnormal surface"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: d96f6c5601c04fdf82b04861fcef0ee5
msgid "隔离并检查生成参数"
msgstr "Isolate it and inspect the generation parameters"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 5e23d574935e48ca8617227261151bc1
msgid "送入 FPS 强行保留"
msgstr "Send it to FPS and force it to remain"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: ee0cb0667a0942baa604d619e3cd7331
msgid "某类真实结构持续高误差"
msgstr "A real structure class has persistently high error"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 2408f32154d7443c8c174cd68809a7d3
msgid "导出该类结构并补充邻近构型"
msgstr "Export that class and add nearby configurations"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 2b0d74b368e84c5181f03c2983a2a323
msgid "只增加完全无关的随机扰动"
msgstr "Only add unrelated random perturbations"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: ccd545b858514e7291791e7df15c12c5
msgid "某组分或磁类型样本很少"
msgstr "A composition or magnetic type is poorly represented"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 25389a289f2c44b2a89d345d2e7d191e
msgid "按研究目标补对应结构"
msgstr "Add structures that match the research target"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: daf336c7ff344a1783f0fa06bd6d4b91
msgid "把“低频”自动等同于“错误”"
msgstr "Automatically treat “rare” as “wrong”"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: 4cec4cf02a24406cb78afc125a451a55
msgid "训练集误差小、独立测试误差大"
msgstr "Training error is small but independent-test error is large"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: b7819d37cc3f402096587017624c3a9e
msgid "检查数据划分和覆盖范围"
msgstr "Check the data split and coverage"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md
#: f2bcb93215aa4d348f0a24ddb49bb19d
msgid "继续只优化训练 RMSE"
msgstr "Keep optimizing training RMSE only"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:51
#: 16d4de4b8ced418590e09b3e0980e11f
msgid "5. 导出可追溯的下一轮输入"
msgstr "5. Export traceable inputs for the next round"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:53
#: 12d977d43c7d4652b88b7862c39ee5fe
msgid "把不同原因的结构分开导出，例如："
msgstr "Export structures with different causes separately, for example:"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:55
#: fcf9ad42beb942228b4f9aff95570551
msgid ""
"review_label_conflicts.xyz\n"
"review_bad_geometry.xyz\n"
"next_round_surface_gap.xyz\n"
"next_round_magnetic_gap.xyz\n"
msgstr ""
"review_label_conflicts.xyz\n"
"review_bad_geometry.xyz\n"
"next_round_surface_gap.xyz\n"
"next_round_magnetic_gap.xyz\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:62
#: f09257f2fa174e0dba33fb1bd1c43b6a
#
msgid ""
"如果需要新生成结构，再回到 `构建数据集`，按缺口选择主卡片。生成后的候选结构仍然要经过 "
"几何检查和代表性采样，不能因为它们来自“高误差结构附近”就默认合理。"
msgstr ""
"If new structures are needed, return to `Make Dataset` and choose the "
"main card for the gap. Generated candidates still require geometry checks"
" and representative sampling; being near a high-error structure does not "
"make them automatically valid."

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:65
#: d9473fa1a3f24065b573a9d5a13cecd4
msgid "跑完检查："
msgstr "After the review:"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:67
#: 098e9b95e2594d83a3258171f9c218fc
msgid "每个导出文件只对应一种明确处理意图；"
msgstr "Give each export file one clear purpose;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:68
#: dbb64cb54e9c47ea9b4bc1684d4f76de
msgid "结构保留原有 `Config_type`，新生成结构追加可追溯标签；"
msgstr ""
"Keep the original `Config_type`, and add traceable labels to generated "
"structures;"

#: ../../source/workflows/review-training-results.md:69
#: def4c334d9484c7a85d17756e879dd1e
msgid "下一轮训练前，能说明每批新增数据解决的具体缺口。"
msgstr ""
"Before the next training round, be able to state which specific gap each "
"batch of new data addresses."
